This repository is a NX monorepo (https://nx.dev) with pnpm as its package manager.
See CLOUD.md for setup steps, env notes, and common commands.
When executing tasks, use pnpm nx run <project>:<task> or pnpm nx <task> <project>.
When installing packages, use pnpm (avoid npm/yarn).
Avoid long-running dev servers unless explicitly requested.
When in doubt, take a look at the online documentation of any tool you want to use/develop with.